commit fa1f9a1013414db2f13159a09f988c32b7626e56
Author: Digital Trekkerr <support@digitaltrekkerr.com>
Date:   Wed Aug 26 13:30:29 2026 +0300

    V2 — apply 6 user-requested features
    
    • R1: Articles stay Arabic-only regardless of app locale
      (comment + arabic-titles invariant test)
    • R2: Profile-edit screen forces API key selection before
      picking a model (bottom sheet + red border highlight)
    • R3: Disable thinking by default across Gemini/OpenRouter/OpenAI-
      compatible providers (switch per template)
    • R4: Disable stream by default + max-output-words = 10000
      (TranslationRequest.maxOutputWords × 2 → max_tokens)
    • R6: PromptTemplate.outputLanguageFixed flag hides the target-
      language selector on home and refuses overlay assignment
    • R7: Copy defaults to plain text; long-press shows plain/Markdown
      options; Share offers plain/Markdown/save-file; overlay channel
      mirrors with native Kotlin stripMarkdown fallback
    
    Adds:
    • strip_markdown package + markdown_stripper utility (12 tests)
    • OpenRouterCapabilities cache (7-day TTL for /api/v1/models)
    • 14 new locale strings (en + ar)
    • Provider tests for Gemini/OpenRouter/OpenAI-compatible
    
    Build: 0.1.5+2010 (was 0.1.5+2009)

